{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Territorial Conquest</strong> is a global real-time strategy game spanning three major eras: the <strong>Middle Ages</strong>, <strong>World War II</strong>, and the <strong>Modern Day</strong>. Command your chosen nation, develop its military, economy, and diplomacy, and lead it to global domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008370/extras/86374d529aec6c0b037833b85068aec9.avif?t=1759958583\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Scope:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a vast roster of nations in each era:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Middle Ages:</i> Portugal, England, Scotland, France, Ottoman Empire, Ming, Joseon, Mali Empire, and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>World War II:</i> Turkey, Portugal, Romania, Spain, Canada, Soviet Union, Italy, China, USA, UK, Germany, Japan, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Modern Day:</i> Turkey, Portugal, Romania, South Korea, Spain, Azerbaijan, USA, UK, France, Germany, Israel, Japan, China, India, and over 30 more.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audio:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiceovers are available for all nations in World War II and Modern eras in multiple languages, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arabic, Chinese, English, Finnish, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Romanian, Russian, Turkish.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nations sharing the same language also share voiceovers for immersion. <i>(Note: Middle Ages era has no voiceovers.)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Strategy:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time strategy with full freedom: join a coalition or break away to conquer the world on your own terms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct strategic bombardments with aircraft and ballistic missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diplomacy, military, and administrative tech trees provide deep strategic development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in trade across all eras with era-specific goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform sabotage operations: poison wells, hack TV stations, compromise air defense systems, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute raids on enemy settlements to steal significant military funds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Unit Variety:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval units: swordsmen, pikemen, cavalry, archers, crossbowmen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern units: riflemen, machine gunners, submachine gunners, mortars, artillery, tanks, armored vehicles, helicopters, planes, anti-air, anti-tank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply units are essential: without them, frontline units lose mobility and combat effectiveness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Political Strategy:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influence your nation\u2019s congress or senate by making key decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct political choices increase your administrative funds and secure seats, while poor decisions empower rival factions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer &amp; Expand:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand borders through conquest or diplomacy, and manage your empire efficiently across three historical eras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters, from military tactics to political maneuvering, affecting your nation\u2019s global standing.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008370?t=1759958583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008370/78f34dcebaad539bb2c9e76c3ecd6c48c2e803f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759958583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008370/05b722318a0314c4baa9b54500afb1e05be77b35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759958583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008370/05b722318a0314c4baa9b54500afb1e05be77b35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759958583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello everyone!</strong><br>I\u2019m U\u011fur, the independent developer behind this game. After months of work I\u2019m happy to finally share the first version with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an Early Access release because I want players to take part in the development. Feedback from the community will help guide what comes next, whether that\u2019s balancing changes, quality of life improvements or new content. I check the Steam forums often and I will listen to suggestions throughout the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The roadmap is flexible and may change along the way. Some of the areas I would like to expand or experiment with in the future are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A larger and more detailed world map<br>\u2022 More playable countries as development progresses<br>\u2022 Wider language support<br>\u2022 Extending the technology trees beyond what is available now<br>\u2022 Trying out new scenarios such as space or historical conflicts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please remember these are goals rather than promises. The direction of development will depend on feedback from players, what is technically possible and the resources available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning. Thank you for supporting the project and I hope you enjoy what is already here while helping to shape what comes next.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Territorial Conquest</strong> is a global real-time strategy game spanning three major eras: the <strong>Middle Ages</strong>, <strong>World War II</strong>, and the <strong>Modern Day</strong>. Command your chosen nation, develop its military, economy, and diplomacy, and lead it to global domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008370/extras/86374d529aec6c0b037833b85068aec9.avif?t=1759958583\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Scope:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a vast roster of nations in each era:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Middle Ages:</i> Portugal, England, Scotland, France, Ottoman Empire, Ming, Joseon, Mali Empire, and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>World War II:</i> Turkey, Portugal, Romania, Spain, Canada, Soviet Union, Italy, China, USA, UK, Germany, Japan, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Modern Day:</i> Turkey, Portugal, Romania, South Korea, Spain, Azerbaijan, USA, UK, France, Germany, Israel, Japan, China, India, and over 30 more.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audio:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiceovers are available for all nations in World War II and Modern eras in multiple languages, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arabic, Chinese, English, Finnish, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Romanian, Russian, Turkish.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nations sharing the same language also share voiceovers for immersion. <i>(Note: Middle Ages era has no voiceovers.)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Strategy:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time strategy with full freedom: join a coalition or break away to conquer the world on your own terms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct strategic bombardments with aircraft and ballistic missiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diplomacy, military, and administrative tech trees provide deep strategic development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in trade across all eras with era-specific goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform sabotage operations: poison wells, hack TV stations, compromise air defense systems, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execute raids on enemy settlements to steal significant military funds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Unit Variety:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval units: swordsmen, pikemen, cavalry, archers, crossbowmen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern units: riflemen, machine gunners, submachine gunners, mortars, artillery, tanks, armored vehicles, helicopters, planes, anti-air, anti-tank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply units are essential: without them, frontline units lose mobility and combat effectiveness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Political Strategy:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Influence your nation\u2019s congress or senate by making key decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Correct political choices increase your administrative funds and secure seats, while poor decisions empower rival factions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer &amp; Expand:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand borders through conquest or diplomacy, and manage your empire efficiently across three historical eras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters, from military tactics to political maneuvering, affecting your nation\u2019s global standing.</p></li></ul>","developers":["U\u011fur CAN"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008370/69b5f4ac8ac362259e612e9ee1147a0228160a8b/header.jpg?t=1759958583","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Stechkom Software. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4008370/778896004/9f140b5c188a7d112818cea61065672e81ee88a1/1758585908/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759958579","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4008370/778896004/9f140b5c188a7d112818cea61065672e81ee88a1/1758585908/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759958579","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4008370/778896004/9f140b5c188a7d112818cea61065672e81ee88a1/1758585908/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759958579","id":257204330,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204330/movie480.mp4?t=1759958579","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204330/movie_max.mp4?t=1759958579"},"name":"Modern Ukraine Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204330/69e81bcac116d1b79dfcaad793cb22c0313faf5b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759958579","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204330/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1759958579","